Komikku for iOS (unofficial port)

This project is a derivative work of Komikku (https://github.com/komikku-app/komikku),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). Komikku itself is a fork of Mihon
(https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon) and TachiyomiSY, also Apache 2.0.

Ported concepts: the source contract (source-api), model fields, source ID generation,
and the database schema (mangas, chapters, categories, history). The code is a clean
Swift reimplementation and has not been tested against Komikku's Android build.
